      {
        "title": "Between 2018 and 2022, seven states have enacted laws requiring written notification of firefighting personal protective equipment that contains PFAS, with most such laws providing for potential civil penalties for non-compliance.",
        "node_id": "0081",
        "start_index": 38,
        "end_index": 38
      },
      {
        "title": "The Company began providing written notices with those products starting November 2022.",
        "node_id": "0082",
        "start_index": 38,
        "end_index": 38
      },
      {
        "title": "In addition, the Company continues to work to determine the extent of any potential non-compliance, has made voluntary self-disclosures to states and customers as applicable, and has expressed its willingness to work with those states to address and resolve any potential non-compliance.",
        "node_id": "0083",
        "start_index": 38,
        "end_index": 38
      },
      {
        "title": "The Company cannot predict at this time the ultimate outcome or actions that may be taken by those states.",
        "node_id": "0084",
        "start_index": 38,
        "end_index": 38
